WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.940
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.740
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.140
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.450
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.400
That's the accelerator screamin', as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.960
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew,
in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.680
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.420
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.320
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.390
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.390 --> 00:01:01.430
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.530
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:13.310
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.640
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:25.650
...the way you avoided me, usin' that naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.960
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:37.730
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.170
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:05.160
Study Abroad in America. Good-bye, Madoka!

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:33.850
Ayukawa's sister got married.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:51.050
But, at that moment...

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:54.100
...I had a feeling that something awful
was about to happen.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.960
It's because...

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:08.890
"Chicago Philharmonic... World-Renowned Violinists... Ayukawas' Daughter marries"

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:14.530
...I learned that Ayukawa's parents
are internationally-famous violinists.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:14.590
"Chicago Philharmonic... World-Renowned Violinists... Ayukawas' Daughter marries"

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:17.560
"First Daughter's marriage a turning point.
Will Ayukawas Seek Permanent Residency in America?"

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.710
What?! No way... Madoka...

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.910
Is that for real, Master?!

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:34.850
Is Madoka going to America for good?!

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:40.660
Yeah... Said she's made up her mind, and wants to go with her parents.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.030
Actually, she was here yesterday to tell me about it.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.870
N...No way... Madoka...

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.800
And, well... she wanted to keep it a secret from you guys.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.940
Darling, I don't want her to go!
I don't want her to!

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:57.110
I don't want Madoka to go!

00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:02.020
It's so like her... to not want
to be seen being sentimental.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:06.290
Oh! She said she'd come say good-bye to you guys before she flies out.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.520
N...No way...

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:11.560
But, then, I think that'd be cruel to you guys.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:15.030
Besides, at the very least,
we'll want to give her a farewell party.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:17.670
A...And, so... Master...

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.700
...w...when is Ayukawa...?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.540
Next Sunday...

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:35.650
"93... 94... 95..."

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.870
That's only three days from now!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:41.320
"96... 97... 98...

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:43.350
"99... 100!"

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:47.670
"No way! There should only be 99 steps!"

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:49.660
"But, I counted them right."

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.290
"99, I said!"

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:52.780
"100!"
"99, I said!"

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:52.860
"99, I said!"

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:55.560
"Okay, then let's make it... 99 1/2 steps!"

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:15.460
"Okay, we'll pretend we don't know 'til the day before she leaves...

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:18.490
"...meanwhile, we'll set up the farewell party."

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.600
No way!

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:24.840
I won't... I won't...

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.950
...I won't let it happen!

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:58.610
I can hear a rondo in the summer sunlight; Dazzled by the radiance, I lend my ears.

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:06.480
At times I look back at
the past out of loneliness.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:14.520
I can see a great crowd at the promenade; People all accompanied by happiness.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:25.250
The passion I once had is gone; I must go find it again.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:33.460
The tenderness you shared with me...

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:36.560
Madoka... once we move,
we'll be able to be together all the time.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:40.740
...since that day, it's slowly faded.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:44.600
I'll even be able to stop by at
your school every so often, huh?
...since that day, it's slowly faded.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:45.440
I needed something definite from you;
I'll even be able to stop by at
your school every so often, huh?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:45.580
I needed something definite from you;

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:51.310
I wonder if the schools there have such a thing as "Parents Visitation Day?"
I needed something definite from you;

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.620
I needed something definite from you;

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.390
Now I've chosen to be alone.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:59.550
Madoka... I'm sorry we
left you alone for so long.
Now I've chosen to be alone.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:00.220
Pages of memories torn from my diary...
Madoka... I'm sorry we
left you alone for so long.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:07.540
Pages of memories torn from my diary...

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:14.510
...make mosaic patterns in the sky.

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:20.510
Like a red spotlight,
the sun sets behind the cityscape...

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.960
Morning!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:46.230
Frankly... I couldn't sleep at all!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:54.400
Yuusaku! Look at you! What happened?

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.080
Er... Well, y'know...

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.380
"What?! What did you just say
about Madoka?!"

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.860
"Who the heck is this bozo?!"

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:07.010
"Dude, you know Madoka?!"

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.460
"Yeah!"

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.300
"Ha! We were just saying
how nice it would be if Madoka...

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.920
"...that bitchy tease,
loosens up a little in America!"

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:20.360
"Then, we could have so much fun with her when she gets back!"

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.210
"You bastard! What do you think you're doin'?!"

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:40.220
"You bastards... I won't let you
get away with this!"

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:45.460
I see... Yuusaku...

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.940
I'm sure Hikaru will be heartbroken.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:51.490
Yo! That doesn't mean that you can get friendly with her, got that!

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:57.450
What?! A farewell party for Ayukawa?!

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.920
Oh, sorry! I've got something I have to do on Saturday.

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:03.320
Could you possibly help out somehow? The more the merrier, you know.

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:07.460
But, you know, we don't exactly
hang out with Ayukawa much, so...

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:09.220
R...Right, Hatta?

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:13.270
Let me see... When "X" is a real number,
this inequality is...

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:17.070
H...Hey! Like, what's this?! NOW you're studying?!

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.620
Why, you! You little...!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:25.040
A...Ayukawa... Good morning!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.100
Good morning.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.520
Ayukawa...

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.320
She wasn't her usual...

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:38.050
Yes... she wasn't her usual "stuck-up, maybe a bit shy and reserved" self.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:42.050
Even I could see that today she was a little different.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:54.900
Er... In this expression, the place
where you're most likely to go wrong...

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.710
...is the direction of the inequality sign...

00:09:56.710 --> 00:10:00.600
...so you'd better review
what we went over last time.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:06.450
That day, Ayukawa didn't even try to look at me once.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:10.040
And, I too thought that...
I too thought that...

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:39.070
Ayukawa...

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:14.400
Kasuga...

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.470
W...Would you wait a minute, Hikaru?!

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:41.110
I brought my own lunch!

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.080
Well, it's not like it's gonna kill you!

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:47.070
I used all my know-how to make it!
I want you to enjoy it!

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:52.340
Okay! Fine... Stop pulling me like that!

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:56.120
Ta-da!

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:11.110
Are you all ready?
Garçons? Mademoiselles?

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.570
Oui! Oui!

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:16.530
Please, Miss Madoka!

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:18.850
Wh... What's with all this?

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:22.970
Well! I made it all by myself!

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.330
Yoo-hoo! And, so, every day from now on...

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:29.940
...we'll be having an
"All-U-Can-Eat" buffet right here!

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.730
E...Every day?!

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:34.900
Right! Tomorrow, and the next day...
and the day after that...

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:37.860
And, then... And, then...

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:40.640
Well, you get the idea.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:44.330
There's no telling how long
this whimsy of Hikaru's will last, but...

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:48.330
Kurumi and I have promised to help out!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:51.810
And, we're gonna make the other girls in our classroom help out too!

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:55.270
Er... Er... my mama was saying...

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:59.890
...that you'll get tired of western food if that's all you're having, so...

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:04.280
...she said she'd make some
stewed daikon radishes for you.

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:15.620
Oh, gawd! Yuusaku, you silly thing!

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:31.400
Okay, then! "For what we are about to receive!"

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:47.770
It sure is good, huh, Hikaru?

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:49.590
Well, duh! Duh!

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:58.930
Oh! N...Nothing...

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:06.150
We've gotta eat... That's right! Gotta eat...

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:08.420
Everyone, together like this, eating.
Even tomorrow...

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:12.490
...and the day after that... and the day after that.

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:16.990
Everybody... with Ayukawa...
we've got to have lunch together!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.920
"I understand, Madoka."

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:15.790
"But... you sure it's going to be all right?"

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:17.610
"What do you mean?"

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:21.080
"About Kasuga, that is."

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:28.140
"Hard as it might be to believe, even I had a few love affairs before I got married."

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:29.260
"So, I..."

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:29.990
"Master!"
"So, I..."

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:30.070
"Huh?"
"Master!"

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:33.000
"Huh?"

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:34.030
"Please..."

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:41.280
"I've... made up my mind."

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:02.540
And, Saturday came...

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:06.000
...but Ayukawa didn't come to school.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.440
What?! Ayukawa wasn't there?!

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.790
I'm afraid so... We went to pick her up, but...

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:25.850
Mrs. A said she'd just vanished, without doing any packing.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:32.330
Not packed yet? But isn't that why she skipped school today, to pack?!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.400
Right?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.050
Er...
Right?

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:34.130
Right?

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:37.870
Oh! No! Hatta!

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.760
Oh, man!

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:42.270
If I may!

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:44.740
Eat this!

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:49.110
Want me to put you in the hospital?

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:11.210
Should we all go out and try to find her?

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:14.910
But... where might she be?

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:18.080
No doubt about it!
It's all because of those bozos!

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:21.140
"Those bozos?!"

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:27.710
O...Oh... You mean those delinquents who were badmouthing Ayukawa?

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:32.180
What? You mean, maybe they wanted to get even?!

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:34.390
We're gonna go look for her, Yuusaku!

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:34.920
Sure!
We're gonna go look for her, Yuusaku!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:35.790
Sempai, you too!
Sure!

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:35.920
Sempai, you too!

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.890
What?!
Sempai, you too!

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:59.920
Maybe it's just like what Yuusaku said...

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:03.330
But, what if... what if Ayukawa feels...

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.430
What if she feels about... as much as I do...

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:09.430
No... It doesn't have to be as much, but...

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:12.570
What if she feels the same... about...

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:15.600
...about me...?

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:41.090
"The Kasuga Family: Takashi, Kyosuke, Manami & Kurumi."

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:45.450
You're late... I'm just not that honest...

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:48.530
...and I'm too selfish.

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:07.790
Good luck...

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:10.860
Good-bye...

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:14.910
95... 96... 97...

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:18.900
98... 99...

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:20.930
100!

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.370
Ayukawa!

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:32.440
Looks like you miscounted again.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:35.380
I knew you'd be here.

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:47.160
You really like this town?
Maybe something's wrong with you, Kasuga!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:51.070
This is just an average town, no different than any other.

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:53.320
Compared to here, America is...

00:20:55.830 --> 00:21:01.480
Well, there's New York... Los Angeles... Hollywood and Beverly Hills.

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:05.730
All kinds of people, and lots of
great things are waiting for me, y'know!

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.710
A...Ayukawa...

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:10.250
Oh, yeah, I forgot!

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:13.800
In order to make it possible,
I've got to study English a lot more!

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.550
I... I...

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:32.940
Ever since I came to this town...

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:37.440
...I've felt that this is
where I wanted to be the most.

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:45.340
Yeah, that's right...
Ever since the day I counted the steps!

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:49.940
Ever since that moment...

00:21:52.090 --> 00:21:54.420
...this town became the best place for me!

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:08.430
Seems when it comes to grown-up stuff...
we're just not that strong.

00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:19.550
A...Ayukawa...

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:25.860
Oh, c'mon, Kasuga!

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:29.550
Did you really think that I'd be going to America for good?!

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:35.360
From the start, I never
intended to move there!

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:36.490
What?!

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:41.340
That's right... I was just trying to trick everyone!

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:42.840
N...No way!

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:04.330
They're gone...

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:09.390
Did Ayukawa... really never intend to go to America...?

00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:19.600
At any rate... Ayukawa's decision to stay...

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:38.630
...was for real.

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:02.520
I dream of casting a spell
that captures your heart...

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:10.100
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:25.450
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.450 --> 00:24:38.060
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.060 --> 00:24:48.270
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.270 --> 00:24:55.280
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:25:06.680
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:18.990 --> 00:25:21.770
Having said that...
I think I'm falling for her too.

00:25:21.770 --> 00:25:26.010
Well, er... maybe I'll ask her
to go to a concert or something.

00:25:26.010 --> 00:25:30.130
Next time: "Everyone is Looking! Hikaru's Super Transformation."
